RNPLens 0.4 — NOTICE
====================

This file travels with the two rnplens artefacts: it is named in pyproject's
license-files, so the wheel carries it as rnplens-0.4.1.dist-info/licenses/NOTICE,
and in MANIFEST.in, so the sdist carries it at the archive root. It is not shipped with
rnplens-assistant, which bundles no third-party code; Part 0 states, entry by entry, which
licence obliges a notice to travel.

This NOTICE aggregates the third-party attributions that the RNPLens distributions are
obliged to carry, and records the provenance and terms of the bundled data. It is a
factual record of what the files and their upstream licence texts state.

RNPLens itself is covered by the MIT LICENSE at the repository root (Copyright (c) 2026
The RNPLens authors), and rnplens-assistant by the byte-identical copy at
assistant/LICENSE. Attribution for first-party code rests entirely on those files: no
source file in the repository carries a licence header or an SPDX-License-Identifier.

Two distributions are built from this tree:
  * rnplens 0.4.1                 — wheel and sdist
  * rnplens-assistant 0.1.1       — wheel and sdist
Membership statements below were verified by full member listing of the built artefacts.


